i.io/tools/brave-leo/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Capacity</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/capacity-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/capacity-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Chatbase</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/chatbase/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/chatbase/</guid><description/></item><item><title>ChatGPT</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/chatgpt/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/chatgpt/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;ChatGPT launched in November 2022 and reached a million users in five days, faster than any consumer product before it. It runs on OpenAI&amp;rsquo;s GPT-4o model, which handles text, images, files, and voice inside a single conversation thread. The interface is approachable enough for someone who&amp;rsquo;s never used AI before, yet the underlying capabilities are deep enough that developers, lawyers, analysts, and writers treat it as a daily work tool.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Claude</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/claude/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/claude/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Claude is built by Anthropic, a safety-focused AI company co-founded by former OpenAI researchers. Where many AI assistants optimise for engagement, Claude is designed to be genuinely helpful without being agreeable to the point of dishonesty: it pushes back, admits uncertainty, and declines requests it considers harmful. That combination of directness and reliability has made it a favourite among people who use AI for serious work rather than casual queries.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Forethought AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/forethought-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/forethought-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Freshdesk</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/freshdesk/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/freshdesk/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Gemini</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/gemini/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/gemini/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Gemini is Google&amp;rsquo;s answer to ChatGPT, and what sets it apart is how deeply it&amp;rsquo;s woven into products people already use every day. It sits inside Gmail to help draft and summarise emails, inside Google Docs to rewrite and restructure text, inside Google Meet to take notes, and inside Android to respond to voice queries. For anyone already living in the Google ecosystem, Gemini often shows up exactly where the work is happening rather than requiring a separate tab.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Gemini Advanced</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/gemini-advanced/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/gemini-advanced/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Gladly</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/gladly-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/gladly-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Google Assistant</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/google-assistant/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/google-assistant/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Gorgias</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/gorgias/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/gorgias/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Helpshift</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/helpshift-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/helpshift-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Intercom</title><l